@startuml
title RF13 — Notificações e mensagens (diretoria, jogadores, franquias) · Diagrama de sequência
skinparam sequenceMessageAlign left
skinparam responseMessageBelowArrow true
autonumber
actor "Head coach / manager (usuário autenticado)" as Manager
participant "Frontend" as Frontend
boundary "API" as API
control "UseCase" as UseCase
control "AuditService" as AuditService
control "MoraleEngine" as MoraleEngine
queue "EventBus" as EventBus
database "MySQL 8" as MySQL
database "Redis 7" as Redis
database "Cassandra 4.1" as Cassandra
participant "Claude (LLM, narrativa)" as Claude
participant "Agendador/Job assíncrono" as Scheduler
actor "Diretoria da franquia (IA)" as Diretoria
actor "Franquia adversária (IA)" as ClubeIA
actor "Jogador (IA)" as JogadorIA
Scheduler -> MoraleEngine: WeekCompleted → generateMessages(save, moral, eventos da semana, seed)
MoraleEngine -> Diretoria: aviso / meta
MoraleEngine -> JogadorIA: reclamação de snaps / pedido de contrato
MoraleEngine -> ClubeIA: proposta de troca com picks
MoraleEngine --> Scheduler: List<InboxDraft>
Scheduler -> MySQL: INSERT inbox_message (UNREAD, options, deadlineWeek)
Scheduler -> EventBus: InboxMessageCreated(saveId, messageId)
EventBus -> Cassandra: appendInbox(saveId) + appendNotification(userId)
EventBus -> Redis: INCR save:{id}:inbox:unread
Manager -> Frontend: abre Inbox
Frontend -> API: GET /careers/{id}/inbox?before=
API -> UseCase: ListInboxUseCase.execute(id, cursor, userId)
UseCase -> MySQL: save + owner check
alt não é dono
  UseCase -> AuditService: record(ACCESS_DENIED)
  API --> Frontend: 403
else senão
  UseCase -> Cassandra: inbox(saveId, before, 20)
  UseCase -> MySQL: status e opções das mensagens abertas
  API --> Frontend: 200 PageResponse<InboxMessageDto>
end
Manager -> Frontend: responde: prometo mais snaps
Frontend -> API: POST /careers/{id}/inbox/{mid}/respond {option}
API -> UseCase: RespondInboxMessageUseCase.execute(cmd) «@Transactional»
UseCase -> MySQL: message (status, options, deadlineWeek)
alt fechada / opção inválida / prazo vencido
  API --> Frontend: 409 | 422
else senão
  alt kind muda outro agregado
    UseCase -> UseCase: InboxEffectDispatcher → caso de uso do RF (RF9/RF14/RF49/RF50/RF64/RF65)
  else senão
  end
  UseCase -> MoraleEngine: react(message, option, moral, seed)
  MoraleEngine --> UseCase: deltaMoral + texto
  UseCase -> Claude: narrate(resposta do remetente) (opcional)
  Claude --> UseCase: texto ou vazio → template
  UseCase -> MySQL: UPDATE message ANSWERED · morale · INSERT resposta
  UseCase -> EventBus: InboxMessageCreated(resposta)
  EventBus -> Cassandra: appendInbox + appendNotification
  API --> Frontend: 200 RespondResult
end
Frontend -> API: POST /me/notifications/read {ids}
API -> UseCase: MarkNotificationsReadUseCase.execute(userId, ids)
UseCase -> Cassandra: markNotificationsRead(userId, ids)
API --> Frontend: 204
@enduml
